    "m_Title": "Sparkle Notes",
    "m_Content": "- Threshhol: density dial. 0.6 is scattered, lower floods it with a specular sheen.\n- Sharpness: controls individual glint size. If its stripes, its too low.\n\nIf wobble is too low relative to threshold, the bands happen too. ",
